        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "summary",
            "heading": "Key ideas from this article",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "A three-year BSc, on its own, is an entry ticket, not a finished career."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Two BSc graduates rarely face the same list."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "needId": "detail:1",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "Two BSc Graduates Rarely",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "JAM has a paper for Physics, Chemistry, Mathematics and Mathematical Statistics."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Hiring at entry level depends on your projects and interview performance more than on the bachelor's label."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "subject-gate",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 1
          },
          {
            "needId": "detail:4",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "JAM and CUET PG Odds, Worked Out",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "The official JAM 2026 statistical report shows 58,622 registrations, 48,170 people who appeared and 15,814 who qualified."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Source: JAM 2026 Statistical and Performance Report (IIT Bombay)."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "What the table says."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "seat-maths",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 4
          },
          {
            "needId": "detail:5",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "Final-Year Calendar Most Students Miss",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Entrance exams for the next step start before you graduate."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "The rhythm follows the 2026 and 2027 notices."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "calendar",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 5
          },
          {
            "needId": "detail:6",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "Seven BSc Career Options",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "We order these by how much the income and role ceiling can grow with skill and proof, not by prestige."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Your BSc plus one multiplier skill, such as SQL and spreadsheets for analytics, GLP and documentation for QC, or clinical-research training, gets you hired without waiting two more years."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "The right move if your target role or research path names an MSc."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "seven-exits",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 6
          },
          {
            "needId": "detail:13",
            "type": "detail",
            "heading": "Questions Students Keep Asking",
            "kind": "items",
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "These are the worries that show up again and again in student question threads."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "Which BSc combination has the most scope."
              },
              {
                "heading": "",
                "text": "That is a rule of access, not a promise of pay."
              }
            ],
            "sourceSectionId": "questions",
            "sourceNeedIndex": 13
          }
        ]
      },
      "type": "summary",
      "title": "Why Your BSc Subjects Decide the Doors"
